rom the state good to  talk to you so many thanks for being  with us charlie you  singer there in colombo uh let's bring  it out to sierra minil fernandez then  who's on the line uh from colombo she's  outside the president's official  residence minell what's happening  are considering there  official there's uh obviously within the  lord  this world of people could not be kept  behind the barricade they had vowed to  come to colombo to sit in to surround  the president's house and basically  make him go now he has been forced uh to  flee that special residence we're  hearing that uh we don't know where he  has been evacuated to and in the  meantime we're also hearing that the  prime minister has now called for a  special all-party leaders conference and  asked for parliament to be summoned now  where i am i mean there are tens of  thousands of people milling about this  is where you have the president's  residence the president's house which uh  the president's official office uh which  is where for the last three months there  has been this concerted and long drawn  campaign uh called protago home and uh  right now the reason you're hearing me  down the phone line is because the  authorities seem to have jammed the data  signal so we can't actually send out  video live video we're only restricted  to the phone  but we hear that even some of the  protesters  are sampling the swimming pool in the  president's official residence and  that's the extent to which people have  sort of overrun that official residence  uh an old ancestral property but people  here are just letting into this center  of emotion where they absolutely fed up  without food uh without gas without fuel  and saying enough is enough we want our  futures back  i'll just  reporting live from outside uh  president uh gotta buy us uh gotcha by  roger pax's uh residence  uh in colombo many thanks indeed middle

